{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-common-biology-36","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":36,"points":null,"unitId":"circulation","unitLabel":"순환·혈액","topic":"혈류·혈압·혈관","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["circulation"],"stem":"인체의다양한기관과조직에공급되는혈류량은소동맥(arteriole)\n의수축또는확장을통해조절된다. 그림은어떤기관에서소동맥의\n수축또는확장이연결된모세혈관혈압에미치는영향을나타낸\n것이다. (단, 동맥의평균혈압은그대로유지된다.)\n위의그림에대한설명이나추론으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 소동맥이확장되면모세혈관을통한물질교환이증가한다.\nㄴ. 소동맥이수축하는경우그래프는(가)의형태가된다.\nㄷ. (나)의경우모세혈관에서의혈류량이증가한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":598,"height":372,"region":0,"bbox":[44.856,82.62,239.2,148.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-36/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":174,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,290.62,308.8,69.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-36/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":11,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.18,416.5,561.328],"width":333.756,"height":409.148,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[44.856,82.62,239.2,148.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,290.62,308.8,69.6],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"36. 인체의다양한기관과조직에공급되는혈류량은소동맥(arteriole)","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.576,11.035],"spans":[{"text":"36.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.385,11.035],"origin":[5.0,13.828],"size":10.752,"flags":0,"font":"T9"},{"te